    rdfs:comment "A data structure encoding surface interaction properties — friction coefficients, coefficient of restitution, density, and drag — that govern object behaviour within a physics simulation engine. Physics materials are distinct from visual rendering materials and are consumed by simulation solvers to produce physically plausible contact responses for metaverse avatars, props, and environments."@en ;
