    rdfs:comment "A comprehensive synthesis document aggregating research findings, literature reviews, and academic insights across Metaverse, Blockchain, Artificial Intelligence, and Robotics domains. It distils empirical evidence, theoretical frameworks, mathematical foundations, algorithm comparisons, implementation guidance, and future research directions for practitioners and stakeholders working across these converging technological fields."@en ;
