    rdfs:comment "An asynchronous audio communication artefact that allows users to record and share spoken messages, conveying prosodic nuance, emotional tone, and contextual richness not available in text. Voice memos occupy a middle tier of communication fidelity between text messages and synchronous video calls, enabling remote teams to maintain natural communication rhythms across time zones without requiring real-time scheduling."@en ;
