ngm:legacy-media a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "legacy media"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Legacy media refers to established, traditional forms of mass communication — including print, broadcast television, and radio — that preceded the digital internet era. These institutions hold significant cultural authority and are undergoing structural disruption as AI-driven platforms alter content distribution and audience economics."@en ;
