    rdfs:comment "The Tourism Industry encompasses the businesses, infrastructure, and services facilitating recreational and business travel, including accommodation, transport, attraction management, and destination marketing. In spatial computing contexts, it is a primary adopter of XR, virtual tourism, and location-based immersive experiences to enhance visitor engagement and extend reach beyond physical access."@en ;
