    rdfs:comment "AR Scene Graph is a hierarchical data structure used in augmented reality to represent and organize spatial relationships between virtual objects, real-world elements, and their transformations, enabling context-aware placement, semantic understanding, and natural interaction between digital cont..."@en ;
