    rdfs:comment "Proprietary Large Language Models (PLLMs) are closed-weight, commercially deployed Foundation Models trained on multi--token corpora by well-resourced AI laboratories, where model weights, training data composition, and architectural specifics are withheld from the public under commercial lic..."@en ;
