    rdfs:comment "Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) are a class of deep generative models introduced by Ian Goodfellow and colleagues at the University of Montreal framing density estimation as a two-player zero-sum minimax game between a generator network G:Z→X mapping samples from a low-dimensional latent p..."@en ;
