    rdfs:comment "AI Companies is the population-level concept comprising commercial and non-profit organisations whose principal economic activity is the research, development, productisation, deployment, distribution, or infrastructure-provision of artificial intelligence technologies—spanning the 2024-2026 indu..."@en ;
