ngm:stable-coins a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Stable Coins"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Stable Coins (stablecoins) are blockchain-native digital tokens engineered to maintain stable value relative to an external reference asset — most commonly the US dollar at 1:1 parity — through one of four primary stabilisation mechanisms: (i) fiat-collateralised custody, where off-chain reserves..."@en ;
