    rdfs:comment "Checkpoints are serialised snapshots of a machine-learning model's complete trainable state — weight tensors, optimiser moment accumulators, learning-rate schedules, gradient scalers, random-number-generator seeds, and epoch/step counters — persisted to durable storage at regular intervals during..."@en ;
