ngm:etsi a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ETSI"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "ETSI (European Telecommunications Standards Institute) is a not-for-profit, independent standardisation organisation that produces globally applicable standards for information and communications technology, including telecommunications, broadcasting, and electronic signatures. Headquartered in Sophia Antipolis, France, it operates under a unique membership model that grants access to industry, research organisations, and governments worldwide. ETSI standards underpin technologies such as 5G NR, NFV, MEC, and the eIDAS-compliant electronic signature formats (CAdES, XAdES, PAdES)."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ngm:infra-network-and-comms ;
