    rdfs:comment "Computer Graphics is the discipline concerned with the computational synthesis, manipulation, and display of visual imagery, encompassing geometry processing, rendering algorithms, shading models, and real-time display pipelines. It forms the technical foundation for spatial computing, game engines, and all visual output in metaverse environments."@en ;
