    rdfs:comment "Machine Learning Pipeline represents the end-to-end workflow for developing, training, validating, deploying, and monitoring ML models. This encompasses data ingestion, preprocessing, feature engineering, model selection, hyperparameter tuning, training, edeployment, and continuous monitoring."@en ;
