    rdfs:comment "A Cross-Chain Bridge is a protocol-level interoperability artefact — comprising on-chain smart contracts on each connected blockchain plus an off-chain attestation, relay, or proving infrastructure — that enables the trust-minimised transfer of fungible tokens, non-fungible tokens, arbitrary mess..."@en ;
