ngm:ai-governance-and-ethics a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "AI Governance and Ethics"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A taxonomy hub encompassing the policies, frameworks, principles, and regulatory mechanisms that govern the responsible development, deployment, and oversight of artificial intelligence systems. This category covers ethical guidelines, accountability structures, safety requirements, bias mitigation, transparency mandates, and legal compliance obligations that collectively shape how AI systems are built and governed."@en ;
